### Edinburgh Castle – tour start times (20 Nov 2024)

Edinburgh Castle runs a set of guided‑tour slots each day. The typical schedule for 20 Nov 2024 (all times GMT) is:

| Time | Remarks |
|------|---------|
| 09:30 | First tour of the day |
| 10:30 | – |
| 11:30 | – |
| 13:30 | – |
| 14:30 | – |
| 15:30 | Last regular tour |

(These slots are the standard offering; exact availability can be confirmed on the castle’s ticketing page.)

