## Recommendation

*If you want to see the castle on the same day:*  
‑ Book the **ITA Airways business‑class flight (09:05 → 12:50)** – it lands well before the 13:30 tour, giving you plenty of time to travel from Edinburgh Airport to the castle (≈ 30 min by taxi or the Airlink 100 bus).

*If you prefer to stay in economy:*  
‑ Take the **Lufthansa/Economy flight (13:45 → 17:10)** and plan to explore Edinburgh on the evening of the 20th, then join the **09:30 tour on 21 Nov**.

Both options give you a comfortable window to reach the castle; the business‑class flight is the only one that lets you experience a tour on the same day.

